{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4e9222f69bf0466371e402e4410999f366858c8bfc0ed47816aead02bf0233d7", "ja": "ワンナイト・ドリーム", "zh": "一夜之梦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b620bb1f6717ea134daaf2822cd9673768e2ff31f5279c1e0442b0fb170efd24", "ja": "夜が明けると、劇場は現代へと戻っていた。\n歩がダンスの振り付けを一からやり直したい\nと言うのに、海美とエレナも快諾。そしてラ\nイブ当日、観客に90年代の空気を伝えるため\nに、4人はステージへ向かうのだった。", "zh": "天亮之后，剧场回到了现代。\n对于步提出想把舞蹈动作从头重新排练的要求，\n海美和艾蕾娜也欣然答应。随后到了演唱会\n当天，为了向观众传递90年代的氛围，\n4人登上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "597924965327c42dc935c17f727ae64e23e3cbcfe9a373fd79771597a30268a6", "ja": "（ユニットの方向性は決まった。あとは\n劇場の魂を呼んで、元の時代に戻るだけ……）", "zh": "（组合的发展方向已经决定了。接下来只要召唤剧场之魂，回到原来的时代就行了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "976588c448b4949f1bd0e1ed96c1a25b3ed59a784e82b6d4f3a36fb5ec4643d8", "ja": "でも、呼ぶってどうすればいいんだ……？", "zh": "可是，要怎么召唤呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "618967c40ca07935fca13eaa4c16bfa55fbad4d4e75f59b175ecba1fc4c9014b", "ja": "あ、あのー、すみませーん……！", "zh": "啊、那个——不好意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "78c33bfc3af0964a150b7d52867b65ff004bb2e61f42657acab171bf024cbc0b", "ja": "はーい！　{$P$}さん、\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "好——！{$P$}先生，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a79922398d51946e78a0476a70604056604d7060eea21a65d6239a28cafa0abd", "ja": "うわっ！！　あ、青羽さん！？\nど、どうしてここに……？", "zh": "哇啊！！青、青羽小姐！？\n你、你怎么会在这里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "3f1696e4188cf80b978e4002eed7939fcd4bb914eaba7a34b165d2ff691b731b", "ja": "どうしてって……もちろん、お仕事だからですよ？\n驚くことじゃないと思いますけど……？", "zh": "你问为什么……当然是因为工作呀？\n我觉得没什么好惊讶的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a860ae5291c0cd3fff32dcda0aca38ab3a7b2e16e7b3a1ccfb6d98bb5df61dd8", "ja": "と、いうことは……。", "zh": "也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "20c8cd9c5d4b52cf856f53f3c5fe2a646d57f10f9ce933490735fcb29b7a7562", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。なんか急に、\nスマホがつながるようになってるんだけど！", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。不知道怎么回事，手机突然能连上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "3b366416504bb65665e55a94f97f97dba7dd65f102cffb4ca5e7e08fdbdd2075", "ja": "あれっ、美咲さんがいる！\nってことは……アタシたち、戻ってこれたの！？", "zh": "咦，美咲小姐在！\n这么说来……我们，已经回来了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "828c534a02de2e61f8fcde6ab5202827dfa061145e581340105d89ad2b5f9a76", "ja": "みんな、おはようございます！\nでも、戻ってきた……っていうのは……？", "zh": "大家早上好！\n不过，说我们回来了……是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "acce36fc87c8667d1ff973ac624699b482ae737a45d18663e5de83b96896948e", "ja": "実は私たち、劇場の魂に90年代に連れてって\nもらったんだ～♪　そこでいろいろ勉強したの！", "zh": "其实我们被剧场之魂带到了90年代～♪在那里学习了各种各样的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "01cf72989378966c66e53aa4d1c43d07a44c9f4467556de26807390946509d8e", "ja": "楽しかったヨ～！　商店街を歩いて、\n当時の空気も味わえたしネ！", "zh": "好开心呀～！还逛了商店街，感受到了那个时代的氛围呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "0164ef2582d6038e7a4e65f2d1175b375d97a8e2f46fd396ee31400b87a7a8d8", "ja": "？　えっと、よくわからないけど……\nプチ合宿、うまくいったってことでいいのかな？", "zh": "呃，虽然不太明白……可以说小集训进行得很顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "3f85a818e7e232700c2f4530973e97b04c58d10b1146cc96ac3eda7329e3cb94", "ja": "うん、もうばっちりだよ！\n美咲さんも、期待しててね！", "zh": "嗯，已经完全没问题了！\n美咲小姐也要好好期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "82734daf93f225532f02dc9f13a5404d1cfaecbee70c9c1b262cc93664fb71d7", "ja": "でも、今から振り付けやり直しだから、\nみんなに負担かけちゃうんだけど……。", "zh": "不过，接下来要重新编舞，会给大家添麻烦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dc00fd320abd76b172360e09319661191683649671e3b5844c9db4816d0cd1a7", "ja": "そうだ、海美とエレナにもちゃんと言わなきゃ！\n実は、ダンスをイチから見直したくて……。", "zh": "对了，也得好好跟海美和艾莲娜说一声！其实，我想从头重新检查一下舞蹈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "06fb5cc47204e446dd76710bffc98781ad408b4068bc5a6ca53471e79b014e33", "ja": "プチ合宿に付き合わせた上に、また最初からなんて、\n無茶言ってるのはわかる。本当にごめん！　でも……。", "zh": "让你们陪我参加迷你集训，还要再从头开始练习，\n我知道自己这个要求很过分。真的对不起！可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "744a68ce1f69693ded7cfc5a730dd8a55c30c203b034220a09d18a35a1912649", "ja": "なんで謝るノ？　ワタシたちのユニットが、\nよくなるためのプチ合宿でショ？", "zh": "为什么要道歉呢？这不是为了让我们的组合变得更好，才进行的短期集训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "97c41f516becf837fcb9ae6c4bd83bdbc68e629ada9adcdde257ac7bce910d40", "ja": "いい方法が見つかって、最高になるってコトでしょ？\nそのほうが絶対、いいと思うナ♪", "zh": "找到好方法后，就能变得更棒了，对吧？\n我觉得那样绝对更好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "2a795fdb089f342fa947821d6ac65222ba0dfcb2a15d8eec778d18e012dbf957", "ja": "そうそうっ！　スケジュールも筋トレも、\nちょっときついくらいが一番力になるしね☆", "zh": "对对！无论是日程安排还是力量训练，稍微辛苦一点才能发挥出最大的效果嘛☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ad20d2808d9daa1640d966e558e3b501e070eceb3afeeda33b8a6eae2e64719f", "ja": "全員一致だな。\nプチ合宿の後だけど……忙しくなるぞ！", "zh": "全员一致啊。\n虽然才刚结束小型集训……接下来可要忙起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "62764c939a30c52097559e498266d59fb386f722d90a98dd8696932fc10ff1d3", "ja": "みんな、{$P$}……！\nありがとう！", "zh": "大家，{$P$}……！\n谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1022_102mis", "source_sha256": "e9c28040b293b6d1b8a41890626e0c0767fcd5af2be6e51cdac34d9985a01bf1", "ja": "ふふっ。みんな、なんだかとってもいい顔してるね！\nどんなライブになるのか、今から楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "呵呵，大家的表情看起来都特别棒呢！\n真期待接下来会是一场怎样的演唱会呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1023_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4bfea54814167ff2c010181760ca700b587df47387fe0863964356974bfff027", "ja": "さて、いよいよライブ当日だ！\nみんな、調子の方はどうだ？", "zh": "那么，终于到了演唱会当天！\n大家状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ad1520b530c56b92bc61bf5249eeda18781d89825510de636728c07bd8e52405", "ja": "ノープロブレムだよ、{$P$}！\nみんなダンスも完璧だし、コンディションも絶好調！", "zh": "完全没问题，{$P$}！\n大家的舞蹈都很完美，状态也正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "850cff306a0984bba601a47d4c8c81d10bcd9626a9dc35be2bb7c6c4b7c463a0", "ja": "今日のステージで、あの90年代体験、\nちゃーんと発揮してみせちゃうからね！", "zh": "今天的舞台上，我会好好发挥那段90年代体验给你看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "5b82beefa492c604e42f3624ce031ea9b37c1de8d3d0a54fe77ecfe34220faeb", "ja": "あのプチ合宿、楽しかったな～。\nもっと続けたかった！", "zh": "那次小集训真开心啊～  \n真想再继续下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "2b7bf447b8fb8f364c31ab4af062e01c9d91bea8ce0985ebf96083745e390944", "ja": "ワタシも、また合宿したいナ～。\nでも、タイムスリップは難しいかも……？", "zh": "我也想再去集训呢～。不过，穿越时空可能有点难吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "f284789f051b4d506a1f5e2e8bd211f17867878a73b2acda21570ed7d49009d9", "ja": "でも、もしもう1回タイムスリップできたら……\n今度こそ、プロレスを観に行けるかも！？", "zh": "不过，要是能再穿越1次的话……这次说不定就能去看职业摔角了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0cd3eda05ba5d471d028550390e632a5445e229607172ed1ee179716bed45ac4", "ja": "せっかくのタイムスリップだったもんね。\nもっといろいろチャレンジするべきだったかな？", "zh": "难得穿越了一次嘛。\n是不是应该多挑战一些不同的事情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e838b29da767073fec305f966d0864a55f14708601fc3024885cee46dba63e2", "ja": "それはまた今度だネ！　また、みんなと\nタイムスリップしたいナ～。エヘヘ♪", "zh": "那就下次再说吧！我还想再和大家一起穿越时空呢～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "85e709fde3dc548f2a3b99546cc31934b41869d37743f269925dbcbab42dffcc", "ja": "頻繁には、勘弁してほしいかな……。でも今日も、\nある意味タイムスリップをする日だよ。", "zh": "偶尔来一次就算了，太频繁的话还是饶了我吧……不过今天也是某种意义上的穿越日哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "7a7a911be03a3418256528bc8c7f13d8a281540c63d891cc1661f4b897e85907", "ja": "ある意味、タイムスリップ……？", "zh": "某种意义上的穿越时空……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "450d2c13103ab0b9933ea4b6877794f9f5fbc727ea9c615c1cf27dc286af11dc", "ja": "うん。みんなの歌とダンスで、お客さん達を\n最高の90年代に連れて行ってほしいんだ。出来るか？", "zh": "嗯。我希望用大家的歌声与舞蹈，\n把观众们带去最棒的90年代。能办到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "1d9ac4af665c370e9ede881609d80981d3ee189667a42731d41dee37b903ea07", "ja": "もっちろん！　まかせて♪", "zh": "当然！交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "79e02ec18524c71c227ed2053323ab151002df4892cd469d5f801ce6e4d73b89", "ja": "ウン！　みんなが踊りたくってたまらない\nステージにしてみせるヨ！", "zh": "嗯！我一定会把它变成让大家忍不住想跳舞的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1037_029umi", "source_sha256": "78bd4c7eb2f6025ee35be566ae5635e0b092afc990280b7b142199eac05f7186", "ja": "ウズウズしてきたっ！\n歩、のりさん、えれなん！　早く行こう！", "zh": "开始按捺不住了！\n小步、法子、艾蕾娜！快走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0135_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0135_story_06_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cef709bd8f82135f3d100b74b9461c788d3cc83e79fe6051f0acd7c57dd618af", "ja": "それじゃあみんな、アタシについてきて！\nフロアを、最高に熱狂させるよー！", "zh": "那大家跟紧我！\n让全场彻底沸腾起来吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
